":false,"color":"orange","labelColor":"black","fill":"semi","size":"s","font":"draw","align":"start","verticalAlign":"start","richText":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• 總指揮與工程決策的裁決者、來源及適用範圍分開。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• 工程 ADR 留在原 repo；引用上層版本，不能反向覆蓋。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• 裁示、身分與行動許可各自核對；任務與驗收沿用原流程。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• 判定保留原文與版本；含糊、衝突、無權或版本不明均不補猜。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"• ADR 沿用 dev2 格式與配號；實質變更新檔，小修保留原話及歷史。"}]}]}}},{"id":"shape:jm-P1-answer-S01-cli-p1-u26","typeName":"shape","x":550,"y":1878,"rotation":0,"index":"aRaMf","parentId":"page:jm-board-P1","isLocked":false,"opacity":1,"meta":{"journey":{"nodeId":"cli-p1-u26","kind":"answer","story":"S01","rendered":"Gap：可信binding指定repo身分，別名不合併；仍待驗。\u0000https://github.com/iamcxa/kc-claude-plugins/blob/docs/kc-decision-log-cli-map/docs/journey/kc-decision-log/p1-technical-contract.md#cli-p1-u26"}},"type":"note","props":{"color":"light-violet","size":"s","font":"draw","align":"middle","verticalAlign":"middle","labelColor":"black","growY":0,"fontSizeAdjustment":1,"url":"https://github.com/iamcxa/kc-claude-plugins/blob/docs/kc-decision-log-cli-map/docs/journey/kc-decision-log/p1-technical-contract.md#cli-p1-u26","scale":1,"textLastEditedBy":null,"richText":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Gap：可信binding指定repo身分，別名不合併；仍待驗。"}]}]}}},{"id":"page:jm-board-P1","typeName":"page","name":"P1（已選／Pilot）— 讀對同一份裁示 — stories, flow & constraints","index":"a5","meta":{}},{"id":"shape:jm-P4b-release","typeName":"shape","x":320,"y":-224,"rotation":0,"index":"aWFIb","parentId":"page:jm-board-P4b","isLocked":false,"opacity":1,"meta":{"journey":{"nodeId":"P4b","kind":"release-label","rendered":"P4b（候選）— 處理跨層衝突並重新裁示\n工程方案引用的上層版本改變或出現衝突時，工程 agent 能呈現影響、交回適用決策者，並把確認後的新版本重新交接。\n\n0/4 stories exist\n← back to the story